ion_">split</span>(<span class=3D"hljs-params">self, text: <span class=3D"h=
ljs-built_in">str</span></span>) -&gt; <span class=3D"hljs-type">List</span=
>[<span class=3D"hljs-built_in">str</span>]:
        <span class=3D"hljs-string">"""
        Split the given text into semantically coherent chunks.
        Chucks are not overlapping group of sentences that are semantically=
 coherent.

        Parameters
        ----------
